<figure><img alt="clipboard_ecb9f4a8ddf6256dc38919ed6a0c2cda2.png" class="internal" loading="lazy" src="https://chem.libretexts.org/@api/deki/files/271425/clipboard_ecb9f4a8ddf6256dc38919ed6a0c2cda2.png?revision=1" />
