<p class="lt-chem-363066">2. Find <em>F<sub>L</sub></em>, the median for the lower half of the data, which for our data is 48.196 g.</p>

<p class="lt-chem-363066">3. Find <em>F<sub>U</sub></em> , the median for the upper half of the data, which for our data is 50.037 g.</p>

<p class="lt-chem-363066">4. The <em>IQR</em> is the difference between <em>F<sub>U</sub></em> and <em>F<sub>L</sub></em>.</p>

<p class="lt-chem-363066">\[F_{U} - F_{L} = 50.037 \text{ g} - 48.196 \text{ g} = 1.841 \text{ g} \nonumber \]</p>

