<p class="lt-chem-363066">and the value of <em>F</em><sub>exp</sub> is</p>

<p class="lt-chem-363066">\[F_\text{exp} = \frac {s_A^2} {s_B^2} = \frac {(0.051)^2} {(0.037)^2} = \frac {0.00260} {0.00137} = 1.90 \nonumber \]</p>

